IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FAIR-SHARE-SCHED.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-TENANTS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TOTAL-BUDGET        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 CHUNK-SIZE          PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 TENANT-CHUNKS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FAIR-SHARE.
    IF NUM-TENANTS == 0 OR CHUNK-SIZE == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE NUM-TENANTS TO TENANT-CHUNKS.
    MULTIPLY 4 BY TENANT-CHUNKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 TENANT-CHUNKS.
    WEIGHT 30 NUM-TENANTS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
